silm:instances_papers_04_forge_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor_1#mittensforgefactorizationsquare silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensForgeFactorizationSquare is In section 'Forge Closure --- Return to Yoneda' the bare symbol RuntimeAtom anchors to MittensForgeFactorizationSquare: The commutative square: manifest hom-profile (top edge) equals trace fingerprint (bottom edge) under the forge factorization; if it fails to commute, the source is rejected at admission." .
